 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-1146) 'latent arm. `routerCalibrated` is 0 in the plan, so that threshold is a
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1146  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-1146) 'starting value rather than a result. A router that picks the wrong arm
 # tags: rfd:decision
